       Q: Should the optimiser treat operator fatigue as a ceiling to stay below (acceptable anywhere in [0, 0.4]) or as a KPI to actively drive down — and if the latter, is there a comfortable operating target (e.g. ≤ 0.25) below which further reduction is no longer worth sacrificing throughput?
