    2. resource_efficiency / assumptions.resource_includes
       Q: What are the relative monetary or equivalence weights for energy, raw materials, and labour hours when they are combined into a single 'resource unit'? For example, if energy costs €0.15/kWh and labour costs €30/hour, a 40 % spike in energy use costs far less than one extra labour hour, so the optimiser will trade them very differently depending on the weighting scheme.
